---
import { INSTALL_COMMAND } from "../../lib/site-facts"
import CopyCommand from "./CopyCommand.astro"
---

<section class="wrap hero">
  <h1 class="h1 h1-72">Observability dashboards<br />for the agentic era.</h1>
  <p class="lead lead-20">
    Ask for a dashboard in a sentence and get one that works, on the Prometheus, ClickHouse, Loki and Tempo you already
    run. Every query runs before it is saved. The dashboards you built in Grafana come along.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-row"><CopyCommand command={INSTALL_COMMAND} /></div>
  <p class="hint">One binary and Postgres. Your data stays in your network; the only call out is to the model you configure.</p>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-top: 96px;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 26px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .h1 {
    max-width: 24ch;
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .hero-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .hint {
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 560px;
    }
  }
</style>
